            "errorPath": "Use AQ:AB instead of PQ:AB."
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "latex": "11:5",
            "errorPath": "Compare the x-coordinates of P and Q, (24/5):(24/11)=11:5, instead of comparing the distance PQ with the entire segment length."
